  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "Seven rounds of 7 handstand push-ups, 7 thrusters, 7 knees-to-elbows, 7 deadlifts, 7 burpees, 7 kettlebell swings and 7 pull-ups, for time. Honours the seven CIA officers killed by a suicide bomber at Forward Operating Base Chapman, Afghanistan, on 30 December 2009. Three loads and seven movements; a long, grinding round.",
